    {
      "datasource": {"type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Single-pane correlation demo\n\nIn three clicks you go from **log line** to **trace** to **flamegraph**, all in one window.\n\n1. In the **Backend Logs** panel (left), expand a row. Click the `trace_id` derived field; Tempo opens with the matching trace.\n2. In the **Tempo Search** panel (right), open a trace. Inside the trace view, click **Profiles for this span** on a backend span. Pyroscope opens with the CPU flamegraph for that exact window.\n3. The bottom **p95 Latency** panel marks where the slow requests are; click the time range there to focus the upper panels on that exact window.\n\nIf no traces show up: check the backend has `OTEL_ENABLED=true` and valid `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS` for Grafana Cloud. Use the `$environment` template variable to switch between `local` and `production` views."
      },
      "title": "Walkthrough",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 12, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"dedupStrategy": "none", "enableLogDetails": true, "prettifyLogMessage": true, "showCommonLabels": false, "showLabels": true, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true},
      "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"}, "expr": "{service_name=\"ams-backend\"} | environment=\"$environment\" | json | trace_id != \"\"", "refId": "A"}],
      "title": "Backend Logs With trace_id (click trace_id → Tempo)",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 12, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo"}, "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"ams-backend\" && resource.environment = \"$environment\" } | select(duration)", "queryType": "traceql", "refId": "A", "tableType": "traces"}],
      "title": "Recent Backend Traces (open one → click Profiles for span)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"ams-backend\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, http_route))", "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}", "refId": "A"}],
      "title": "Find Slow Handler (then look at logs + traces above)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "pyroscope", "uid": "pyroscope"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 32, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25},
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "pyroscope", "uid": "pyroscope"}, "groupBy": [], "labelSelector": "{service_name=~\"ams-backend.*\"}", "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds", "queryType": "profile", "refId": "A"}],
      "title": "Pyroscope CPU Flamegraph (ams-backend.*)",
      "type": "flamegraph"
    }
  ],
